Package: nabu-tablet-mode
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, iio-sensor-proxy, psmisc
Description: Tablet mode switch helper and sensor resume hook for GNOME/Plasma on Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu)
 Enables automatic screen orientation and tablet-mode detection for GNOME Mutter
 and KDE Plasma, while handling fast sensor wake/resume over SLPI/FastRPC.
